🧠 Recommended thresholds look sensible: min_genes=200 (removes only 111 low-quality cells), max_pct_mt=5.0 (no effect since mito genes are absent, but harmless as a safeguard), min_cells=3 (no genes removed, low risk). Let's apply these.
