Cell-type proportions were compared between stim and ctrl per donor (paired Wilcoxon signed-rank test, {{comp.test}}, {{input.n_donor}} donors per condition, Benjamini-Hochberg corrected). {{comp.n_significant}} of {{comp.n_cell_types}} cell types reached significance after correction. {{table:composition_test}}

